  "description": "Make videos you\u2019re proud to share with Edits, the new video creation app from Instagram. \n\nEdits is a free video editor that makes it easy for creators to turn their ideas into videos, right on their phone. It has all the tools you need to support your creation process, all in one place. \n\nSimplify your creative process \n\n  \u2022 Export your videos in 4K with no watermark and share to any platform. \n  \u2022 Keep track of all your drafts and videos in one place. \n  \u2022 Capture high-quality clips up to 10 minutes long and start editing right away. \n  \u2022 Easily share to Instagram with high-quality playback. \n\nCreate and edit with powerful tools \n\n  \u2022 Edit videos with single-frame precision. \n  \u2022 Get the look you want with camera settings for resolution, frame rate and dynamic range, plus upgraded flash and zoom controls. \n  \u2022 Bring images to life with AI animation. \n  \u2022 Change up your background with green screen, cutout or add a video overlay. \n  \u2022 Choose from a variety of fonts, sound and voice effects, video filters and effects, stickers and more. \n  \u2022 Enhance audio to make voices clearer and remove background noise. \n  \u2022 Generate captions automatically and customize how they appear in your video. \n\nInform your next creative decisions \n\n  \u2022 Get inspired by browsing reels with trending audio. \n  \u2022 Keep track of ideas and content you're excited by until you're ready to create. \n  \u2022 Track how your reels are performing with a live insights dashboard. \n  \u2022 Understand what affects your reels engagement.\n\nMeta Terms: https://www.facebook.com/terms.php\nMeta Privacy Policy: https://privacycenter.instagram.com/policy",
